    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Mathematics has always been a profound source of intellectual fulfillment for me. As someone with a PhD in computer science, I find its logical structure and problem-solving elegance deeply satisfying. It’s not just about numbers; it’s about patterns, proofs, and the beauty of abstraction. While I don’t see it as a daily necessity outside my work, I appreciate its role in shaping how we understand the world.",
